label chapter_one:

    scene bg class at bg_fit with dissolve

    show screen chapter_card("Chapter 1", "Everyone Is Suspiciously Good Looking")

    show teachertalking at center_char with dissolve

    teacher "Alright, settle down."
    teacher "I know none of you are going to listen to me anyway."
    teacher "But let's at least pretend."

    hide teachertalking
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "First day of class."
    thought "I sat in the middle — not too close to the front, not too far back."
    thought "Neutral territory."
    thought "I was going to be invisible today."
    thought "That was the plan."

    show sarasmilequiet at left_char with dissolve

    npc1 "That's Sara Lee, right?"
    npc2 "She's so pretty..."
    npc1 "I heard she scored first place on the entrance exam."

    thought "Please stop staring at me like that."
    thought "I just met all of you today."
    thought "Let me look somewhere else."

    hide sarasmilequiet
    show wooquiet at right_char with dissolve

    thought "Woo Ju-in."
    thought "First year of high school and he already looks like that."
    thought "How."

    hide wooquiet
    show woosmile at right_char

    npc1 "ACK—"
    npc2 "HE SMILED AT ME—"
    npc1 "NO HE SMILED AT ME—"

    hide woosmile
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char

    thought "Yeah. Any other day I'd be reacting the same way."
    thought "But right now I'm too busy noticing that nobody finds it strange."
    thought "The hair colors. The eye colors. The fact that this class looks like a casting call."
    thought "Nobody finds any of this strange."
    thought "Just me."

    thought "Huh. A message."

    show screen phone_notification("Sara ♡", "Soo-ah, are you feeling okay?")
    pause 2.5
    hide screen phone_notification
    pause 0.3

    thought "Her number is saved in my phone."
    thought "Under a heart."
    thought "I have never saved anyone's number under a heart in my life."
    thought "Just what is happening to me."

    show npcquiet at left_char with dissolve

    npc1 "Hey — you came in with those three this morning, right?"
    soo "Huh? Oh. Yeah, we just walked in together."
    npc1 "Do you know them?"
    soo "No. We literally just met at the gate."
    npc2 "Oh really? What a coincidence."
    npc2 "You know Min-ho? He's been coming to school in a limousine since elementary."
    npc1 "Son of a major family. Scored first place across the whole school."
    npc2 "And Woo Ju-in has been his best friend since they were little."
    npc1 "IQ over 200 apparently. Remembers everything he sees."
    npc2 "And Eunhyeong — class president before anyone even voted."
    npc1 "Teachers love him. Students love him. He's good at everything."

    thought "This girl is literally introducing characters to me."
    thought "She doesn't know that. But she is."

    npc2 "And then there's Yoo Chun-yeon."
    npc1 "He models. His uncle is a famous photographer."
    npc1 "But he never talks to girls. Not once."
    npc2 "So mysterious~"

    hide npcquiet

    thought "..."
    thought "Four of them."
    thought "All in my class."
    thought "All impossibly good looking."
    thought "All with some kind of dramatic backstory."
    thought "And Sara Lee — beautiful, first place, sitting right next to me."
    thought "If this were a novel, she'd be the protagonist."
    thought "Which means I'm..."
    thought "The side character."
    thought "The normal one."
    thought "The one who watches everything happen and makes commentary."
    thought "..."
    thought "Actually that's fine."
    thought "That's completely fine."
    thought "Side characters don't get their lives turned upside down."
    thought "Side characters go home at a normal time and eat dinner."
    thought "I can work with this."

    show npcquiet at left_char with dissolve

    npc1 "Hey — what should we call those four?"
    npc2 "What do you mean?"
    npc1 "Like a group name. They're always together."
    npc2 "Ooh..."
    npc1 "The Four... Kings?"
    npc2 "The Four Stars?"
    npc1 "The Four Seasons?"
    npc2 "Oh! The Four Pillars!"
    npc1 "..."
    npc1 "The Four Pillars sounds like a construction company."

    thought "It really does."

    npc2 "Then — The Panel Kings?"
    npc1 "...What?"
    npc2 "Like. They look like they belong in a manhwa panel."
    npc1 "..."
    npc1 "Actually that's perfect."
    npc2 "Right?!"

    hide npcquiet

    thought "The Panel Kings."
    thought "I cannot believe that just happened."
    thought "I cannot believe I am living inside a story where that just happened."
    thought "This is not real."
    thought "This cannot be real."

    show sooneutraltalk at center_char

    soo "..."
    soo "Pfft."

    hide sooneutraltalk
    show sooneutralquiet at center_char

    thought "Okay."
    thought "Okay okay okay."
    thought "I need to calm down."
    thought "I am going to be a side character."
    thought "I am going to be invisible."
    thought "I am going to survive this."

    jump chapter_2
